[{"title":"闻喜五咏 其五 荣释褐衣","author":"赵完璧","text":"褐衣本自草莱衣，圣主登崇革贱微。\n野水烟裾迥佩玉，云山芝袖谢牙绯。\n春风文炳于菟变，化日仪瞻綵凤飞。\n一介宠光何所报，仲山衮补勉归依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13393,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月初寒围炉小饮","author":"赵完璧","text":"一壶春酒对红炉，十月初寒慰老夫。\n云影满窗松影乱，雪花点地柳花铺。\n弄孙清夜歌唐句，教子彤庭效禹谟。\n一枕游仙欢赏后，楼台深处拟蓬壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13394,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"掖邑张南溪老友以赵见亭侍御诗扇见遗用韵寄答二首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"日攀危磴俯回溪，游赏清樽迥自携。\n花气喜涵香霭榭，潮声惊落矗云堤。\n修篁对酌风前舞，好鸟窥人林外啼。\n醉里狂歌閒里卧，簪裳回首是沙泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13395,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"掖邑张南溪老友以赵见亭侍御诗扇见遗用韵寄答二首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"衰翁无复志磻溪，山海逍遥一杖携。\n寻话野僧春日寺，听蝉高柳夕阳堤。\n閒情不遣花空落，清赏曾教鸟自啼。\n遥向旧知挥醉笔，休教翰苑鄙尘泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13396,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桐阴","author":"赵完璧","text":"瑶台郁郁绿生寒，净扫莓苔坐自看。\n日下平铺金翡翠，月明齐上玉栏干。\n来仪拟集丹山瑞，戏剪休教紫禁残。\n老我琴书孤樾下，不知冠盖满长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13397,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳色","author":"赵完璧","text":"翻风弄日翠依依，逐岁春妍故不违。\n映渚不随流水去，临岐常送玉骢归。\n台城堤上无兴废，陶令门前有是非。\n莫向笛声怨憔悴，好随烟叟上鱼矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13398,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹韵","author":"赵完璧","text":"幽响萧萧隔座回，秋声遥送楚湘来。\n惊风满院清如许，度霭閒窗静可猜。\n琼佩人归明月下，绿琴调合碧云隈。\n高斋剩有衔杯趣，七子襟怀旷古开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13399,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蕉声","author":"赵完璧","text":"繁諠庭下卒难收，风雨番番可自由。\n朱箔不堪云悄悄，绿窗无柰夜悠悠。\n绮罗萃蔡惊初度，金石琤锵听未休。\n独倚珊瑚向残漏，不成蝴蝶恼庄周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13400,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵高双泉翁登楼写怀","author":"赵完璧","text":"雨霁烟萝故故凉，悠然尘外岂皇皇。\n垂纶适慰依沧海，緤马曾教度太行。\n画阁捲帘舒远眺，清泉煮茗润枯肠。\n山人本自无多事，酬倡新诗静里忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13401,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慎修以夏曹郎出守维扬经年怀想间书来鬓渐生白因而感赋","author":"赵完璧","text":"庭教原来辅圣明，十年燕阙又江城。\n嗟予斜日青山暮，闻尔秋霜绿鬓生。\n南雁怪迟沧海信，北堂莫慰綵衣情。\n遥知謇謇难为孝，不遣书题老泪倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13402,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵丁丑除夕","author":"赵完璧","text":"衰老头颅尽巳丝，挑灯又送腊归时。\n心慵万事惭予拙，骨隐馀酸秪自知。\n倏去年华怜柏酒，几回春色向花期。\n玄修巳与灵龟合，讵向人间一朵颐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13403,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵书怀三首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"红尘回首笑牵丝，正尔烟霞放浪时。\n碧水青山如有待，好风良月属相知。\n侯封姜望今非望，寿拟安期那可期。\n陶意琴尊从白首，不将熊鸟作颠颐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13404,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵书怀三首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"高节桐江慕一丝，壮心苦惜暮年时。\n随珠夜掷多相讶，楚璞烟涵几见知。\n碧柳自栽栖靖节，朱弦欲奏失钟期。\n危楼惟有沧溟月，弄向清风一解颐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13405,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵书怀三首 其三","author":"赵完璧","text":"冥搜太苦绎蛛丝，得意酣歌向暮时。\n花鸟閒情惟我适，松篁雅操更谁知。\n名虚蝴蝶须臾梦，身寄蜉蝣浩漫期。\n事变古今堪大笑，悲丝何必泪交颐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13406,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭内弟高介亭二首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"一宿中宵陨帝京，悲风飞讣过逢瀛。\n伤心迢递还疑梦，泪眼潺湲且未晴。\n英采何归空抱恨，远书犹在可堪情。\n芙蓉别馆尘凡杳，肠断朱弦夜夜声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13407,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭内弟高介亭二首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"英才何事委穷尘，痛绝清时失凤麟。\n分桂有情怜帝子，种花遗惠哭丘民。\n道旁说易期何夕，地下修文是几春。\n独倚东风一相吊，知予沧海更何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13408,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊寅新正四日雪中用唐韵一首","author":"赵完璧","text":"粉蝶惊春下短墙，杨花早点鬓边霜。\n月明迥彻清虚府，帝泽先沾绿野堂。\n秾李骇看初岁艳，枯槎犹借一时妆。\n园林是处生春色，愁杀穷荒仗节郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13409,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"已夘新正年登八帙家宴偶成","author":"赵完璧","text":"青眼明时八十春，白头窃拟渭滨人。\n青藜不用扶衰骨，绛雪何须健老身。\n凰凤双偕桃洞久，桂兰叠见武陵新。\n神仙犹恐虚无迹，欢会蓬瀛此更真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13410,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵登城楼","author":"赵完璧","text":"苦悲尘市上高楼，老眼遥开天际头。\n弦管云霄穷昼夜，海山今古几风流。\n汪洋万里樽前兴，紫翠千重分外幽。\n一纵豪吟来胜概，雅怀曾计末龄遒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13411,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金井","author":"赵完璧","text":"小铺金井碧粼粼，琼玉参差照眼新。\n花落清防俗客至，苔生喜趁绿钱匀。\n月明细浪声沉夜，雨霁如筛净脱尘。\n醉向晚风从健倒，摩挲惊汝莫相嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13412,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月十二夜","author":"赵完璧","text":"几日烦襟暑不清，天街此夕慰凉生。\n翩翩华月随潮上，霭霭青烟抱树轻。\n露下寒蛩悽四壁，风前清漏杳孤城。\n秋堂欲问如何夜，竹影依稀石径横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13413,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春山","author":"赵完璧","text":"学弯新月两分明，春霭连山淡欲盈。\n入室纤蛾曾见嫉，隔墙横翠重关情。\n王书不至双规损，黛色初匀八字轻。\n宛度清扬桃扇底，怕教心捧更倾城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13414,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋波","author":"赵完璧","text":"翠湖初落熨晴波，明媚秋生奈尔何。\n金雁月辉珠未稳，玉台云散镜初磨。\n霜红密意盈盈度，银浦幽情脉脉多。\n几许清光无限恨，姑苏一瞬罢吴歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13415,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄海野妹丈三首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"可惜仙才黄海翁，秋风星陨海山东。\n惊人綵笔原无敌，直已清朝本至公。\n湘水不归兰蕙老，长沙吊去古今同。\n苍生莫慰当年望，横涕滂沱哭上穹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13416,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄海野妹丈三首 其二 逆前韵","author":"赵完璧","text":"有怀无路诉苍穹，泉下人间渺不同。\n何日化归华表鹤，千年肠断石城公。\n青山南卧心犹北，白发西沉我尚东。\n终日忆君君我弃，空馀残梦哭山翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13417,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄海野妹丈三首 其三 错前韵","author":"赵完璧","text":"暮景衰残尔我同，断云落日已辞公。\n伤怀问疾虚青简，无计招魂向碧穹。\n辽海燕山总春梦，惠音良晤失佳翁。\n痛君洒尽平生泪，淮水无情日夜东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13418,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自伤二首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"幻身千古尽凋残，是几登仙几涅槃。\n迷境难开千眼相，衰颜谁驻九还丹。\n晚来岁月惊如掷，老去情怀澹自酸。\n冥造不须愁里误，酒杯端合强追欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13419,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自伤二首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"同游渐损逝川波，病体支离奈老何。\n甲子已周仍有几，春秋过盛亦无多。\n仙凡枘凿终难合，海岳沈迷岂易磨。\n学道未成双鬓雪，悠悠人事日蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13420,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中偶书","author":"赵完璧","text":"瑶霙万里逐风回，漠漠穷阴冷不开。\n野水冰连龙甲去，海山碧浸玉壶来。\n八荒旋作残年瑞，三尺仍馀浩劫灰。\n独倚老松醒醉眼，平原不辨楚王台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13421,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日观雪","author":"赵完璧","text":"青灵乍喜布阳和，滕六侵权恣意过。\n漠漠彤云昏日月，皑皑白昼失山河。\n东风欲拂全无力，宿莽初萌且奈何。\n老眼仰天开一粲，翻飞看作扑灯蛾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13422,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中潘边二老见枉夜归有怀","author":"赵完璧","text":"黯黯山城暮雪天，幽轩解榻集英贤。\n蓬云寒度潘邠老，竹霭清延边孝先。\n暖玉醲醺醒紫茗，博山香散拂朱弦。\n情澜未竭仙舟放，无影月中人不眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13423,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"首夏雨后晓起","author":"赵完璧","text":"列缺奔云裂海山，夜阑雨歇晓开关。\n修篁睡鹤寒烟紫，小院无人细草斑。\n啼鸟不来诗兴寂，落花飞尽酒杯閒。\n苍苔满地抱孤闷，独眺沧溟缥渺间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13424,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和穆少春前赐诗扇二首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"疏狂取笑草鸣虫，岂为幽兰播远风。\n曾愧鲤庭无异教，误将鼠璞试良工。\n玉堂綵笔驰声久，丹桂青云奕世雄。\n池上凤毛今不爽，海人休说郢人同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13425,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和穆少春前赐诗扇二首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"书翰忘辛拟蓼虫，酒酣随意洒清风。\n脂铅不识惭愚妇，剞劂无能愧拙工。\n孙厩飞黄来藻鉴，薛函结绿际豪雄。\n玄珠未必遗沧海，此日何堪象罔同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13426,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和穆少春后赐诗扇二首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"翰墨齐纨谢鲍才，龙门迢递恨难裁。\n银盘烂自沧溟吐，锦绮新从蜀水来。\n白发可能承玉唾，清风犹慊涤烦埃。\n神交徒尔侵衰暮，却幸儿曹侍酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13427,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和穆少春后赐诗扇二首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"抱瓮忘机老汉阴，诗从凤沼忽惊心。\n孤高莫和阳春曲，千载俄闻大雅音。\n武库乍开寒凛凛，文虹遥射影沉沉。\n诗豪适快明时睹，悔爇猩毫自不禁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13428,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五杂组 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"五杂组，宫姝色。\n往复还，歌换拍。\n不得已，东方白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13429,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五杂组 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"五杂组，便佞口。\n往复还，豺虎走。\n不得已，中散酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13430,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翟家嘴道中","author":"赵完璧","text":"高山崭岩，冰溪冱结。\n北风凛如，同云雨雪。\n太荒阴烟，飞鸟欲绝。\n仆夫恍然，征车未辍。\n前途何依，想望天阙。\n怆彼东溟，我心已折。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13431,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过西岩寺山","author":"赵完璧","text":"陟彼东巘，寒云苍苍。\n驱我轩车，险阻且长。\n猿猴我戏，虎豹我当。\n冰雪蔽途，顾望斜阳。\n左攀双辀，右怂干将。\n奋然万里，以趋康庄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13432,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高玉翁左史见枉用韵赋简五首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"夜堂酣若下，春豆荐王馀。\n酒兴珊珊后，乘龙过太虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13433,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高玉翁左史见枉用韵赋简五首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"孤云弃朱祓，五柳谢金鱼。\n萧散风尘外，相将慰索居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13434,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高玉翁左史见枉用韵赋简五首 其三","author":"赵完璧","text":"山鸟避人飞，丘林遁自肥。\n不缘黄鹤度，尽日锁烟扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13435,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高玉翁左史见枉用韵赋简五首 其四","author":"赵完璧","text":"春残兼暮景，志协怨离居。\n处处堪乘兴，时时有报书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13436,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高玉翁左史见枉用韵赋简五首 其五","author":"赵完璧","text":"南极星飞彩，东溟月渐西。\n青藜扶去晚，伴影度云溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13437,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感物二首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"欲系日沉彩，欲障水湍流。\n东西不我与，耿耿心独忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13438,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感物二首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"嗟嗟三闾子，不复得怀王。\n早以蕙兰误，岂虞萧艾香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13439,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春閒四首 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"曦射窗烟破，风飘花露寒。\n莺声清梦觉，春色独凭栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13440,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春閒四首 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"莺啭玉笙细，苔涵碧锦滋。\n杨花春欲暮，睡起和陶诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13441,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春閒四首 其三","author":"赵完璧","text":"寂寂閒庭静，离离春草生。\n朱帘白日永，空复落花情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13442,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春閒四首 其四","author":"赵完璧","text":"春阴山馆閒，云静松花老。\n玉琴寂不调，清觞为谁倒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13443,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春有感","author":"赵完璧","text":"东风吹老鬓，衰槁渐成银。\n不及閒庭草，年年绿意新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13444,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草露","author":"赵完璧","text":"漙漙草上露，珠玑明日华。\n岂不照青眼，须臾良可嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13445,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盐城独坐","author":"赵完璧","text":"独坐淮南邑，经年不可禁。\n囊琴望秋浦，对曰又西沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13446,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感朝雨","author":"赵完璧","text":"昨夜众星列，今朝雨不绝。\n天时无定期，人情那可说。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13447,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感","author":"赵完璧","text":"早有看花兴，烟云竟不开。\n每当花时节，肠断几千回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13448,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鬓上偶见一白","author":"赵完璧","text":"鬓上一茎雪，眼中一点血。\n万事竟蹉跎，难教心似铁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13449,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝应湖渔舟","author":"赵完璧","text":"湖天一叶舟，举网此生谋。\n几许风波恶，艰危不自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13450,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小箑芙蓉图","author":"赵完璧","text":"幽石结灵根，繁华不相识。\n仙姿媚晚秋，金屋无颜色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13451,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"赵完璧","text":"凉月叫残蟋蟀，西风落尽梧桐。\n满耳秋声不寐，寂寥延伫庭中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13452,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日","author":"赵完璧","text":"微雨洗明苔色，暖风吹破桃花。\n竹里酒醒无事，徘徊春日西斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13453,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿静宁州","author":"赵完璧","text":"疏竹半窗横影，浓霜满院飞花。\n梦破烧残红蜡，更阑冷坠金蟆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13454,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚游温玉斋官邸亭台 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"幽境亭虚绿荫，良宵花落青灯。\n残月苍苍人去，断云梦寐武陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13455,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚游温玉斋官邸亭台 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"醒眼楚台烟月，推襟晋代风流。\n中夜烧残绛蜡，孤城唱彻银筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13456,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨晓看菊","author":"赵完璧","text":"向晓疏篱看菊黄，夜来微雨沐新妆。\n西风好待吹云霁，合送清香到玉堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13457,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊小饮","author":"赵完璧","text":"小径黄花艳艳开，晚风时有异香来。\n长杨红粉知多少，争似年年照酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13458,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青州道中观古冢","author":"赵完璧","text":"荒冢累累春草青，行人指点未分明。\n英雄寂寞前朝迹，落日东风恨未平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13459,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道遇寒食忆宋之问马上逢寒食句五咏其韵 其一","author":"赵完璧","text":"鞦韆女儿桃李下，柳外行人驻征马。\n骄马嘶风桃李香，愁人落日云平野。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13460,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道遇寒食忆宋之问马上逢寒食句五咏其韵 其二","author":"赵完璧","text":"东风浩浩吹平旷，红泪纷纷号冢上。\n满地梨花春又来，松楸海上悽行况。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13461,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道遇寒食忆宋之问马上逢寒食句五咏其韵 其三","author":"赵完璧","text":"荒村寒食雨濛濛，柳拂娇青桃欲红。\n山馆留连聊把酒，佳时尘世苦难逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":13462,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]